# Never send local build artifacts into the Docker build context — a
# fresh GitHub checkout (what Render actually builds from) never has these,
# but a local `docker build` run from this machine does, and copying them in
# silently overwrites the node_modules the Dockerfile's own COPY --from=deps
# steps placed correctly, with local-machine-specific (often broken) ones.
node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.tsbuildinfo
